			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 705120701,
					"content": "The fight is over. Diluc wiped the floor with them... Guess some things haven't changed.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120702
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120702,
					"content": "So is there any actual danger here? It looks like it's only these illusions from the past.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120703,
						705120704
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120703,
					"content": "Diluc must have already been here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120705
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705120705,
					"content": "So, Diluc's already called it a day?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120706
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120706,
					"content": "Will more monsters come out if we go up to that weird ley line deposit again? And what about young Diluc?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120707
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120707,
					"content": "If it's like the other ley line deposits we've seen, then it should've disappeared now that all the monsters are defeated.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120708,
						705120709
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120708,
					"content": "So young Diluc's piqued your interest?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120710
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705120710,
					"content": "No, no, hehe, Paimon's just a little worried is all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120711
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120711,
					"content": "What if someone passing by gets curious, comes to check it out, then suddenly \"Yaah!\" A monster jumps out and clubs him over the head with a \"swish\" and a \"smash\"? That would be terrible.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120712
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120712,
					"content": "...Why the sound effects?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120713
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705120713,
					"content": "...Because it sounds more dangerous that way!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120714
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120714,
					"content": "Anyway, we came here to help Diluc, didn't we? So let's stick around a little longer and make sure this place is completely safe before we head back.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120715
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120715,
					"content": "You've got a strong sense of responsibility.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120716
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705120716,
					"content": "Hehe... Not really. Paimon just wants some fancy grape juice.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120717
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120717,
					"content": "#Come on, {NICKNAME}, let's finish what we came for. When we get the grape juice, you can have some of Paimon's half!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 705120709,
					"content": "Or have you suddenly developed an interest in ley line anomalies?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120710
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 705120704,
					"content": "At most, there might be a few remnants left.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						705120705
					]
				}
			]
		},
